WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:05.540
So let's now go from the culture war question
to one about rights and responsibilities.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.519
We talked about the Trump administration turning
Corona virus into a culture war because they

00:00:09.519 --> 00:00:11.740
have to they're losing on the science.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.459
So they're making it a culture war.

00:00:13.459 --> 00:00:17.010
Now, I want to focus in on the so-called liberty.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.500
Corona virus protesters.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:24.500
The people talking about liberty and government
tyranny as the reasons why states must open

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.200
and masks must not be worn and I need my hair
dyed and all of this stuff.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.640
They are the ones talking about why churches
and restaurants and hair salons must all be

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:34.640
open right now.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.970
I have to tell you, I'm sympathetic to their
desires.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:38.970
I'm sick.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.270
I want everything open as soon as possible.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:48.280
I believe we are only needing to be this closed
because of early failures by not just the

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.790
Trump administration, but also many governors.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:58.180
I am skeptical of a total indefinite shutdown
as an even remotely reasonable thing that

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:01.460
could or should extend more than a minimum
amount of time.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:05.260
It's bad for people's mental health, it's
terrible for the economy.

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:12.500
But the thing is, I'm regularly proving my
level of responsibility that would go with

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.159
the freedoms that I want.

00:01:14.159 --> 00:01:21.640
And the problem is that these protesters and
these so-called tyranny people regularly prove

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:26.060
they can't be responsible with the freedom
they claim an absolute right to.

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:31.299
I don't know if this idea originally came
from ELEANOR Roosevelt, but she once wrote,

00:01:31.299 --> 00:01:35.400
quote, Freedom makes a huge requirement of
every human being.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:40.610
With freedom comes responsibility for the
person who is unwilling to grow up.

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:44.030
The person who does not want to carry his
own weight.

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:47.220
This is a frightening prospect.

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:54.380
Restrictions on freedom essentially stem from
people abusing freedoms and forcing a restriction

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.300
on those so-called freedom.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.820
So let's let's really dig into it and understand
it.

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.930
First of all, I want to be clear.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:05.060
When the gun people for the last 10 years
that I've been doing the show talk to me about

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:09.650
government tyranny, I never imagined they
were talking about wearing a mask and staying

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:10.869
home to watch Netflix.

00:02:10.869 --> 00:02:11.869
Right.

00:02:11.869 --> 00:02:13.560
That that we never imagined.

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:15.500
That's actually what they were talking about.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:19.390
But let's take them at their word that this
is tyranny as they see it.

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:22.090
And it's about the economy and it's about
liberty.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:26.730
If everyone were responsible, we wouldn't
need nearly as many restrictions when you

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:28.370
were talking about a virus.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:30.930
A few people can ruin it for everybody.

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:36.560
There's one recent study which estimated 80
percent of the spread is caused by 9 percent

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:37.890
of the people that are infected.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:42.120
In other words, most people who have the virus
are infecting anyone.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:44.160
They are infecting zero people.

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:49.770
A small number of people are infecting a whole
bunch of others.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:55.480
Now, some of these are, of course, not irresponsible
behavior.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:58.410
People that are causing the spread, but many
of them are.

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:03.670
And so the very people demanding absolute
and total freedom have in many cases show

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:08.150
no evidence that they can actually bear the
responsibility that comes with that freedom.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:13.120
The same people demanding everything reopen
are often the people continuing to have mass

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:17.290
gatherings, hosting huge services at their
megachurch, refusing to wear a mask as some

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.850
kind of political statement.

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:24.370
The reason governors had to put in place restrictions
and then stricter restrictions and then stricter

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:28.940
restrictions is because simply communicating
the facts about the disease didn't get people

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.190
to act responsibly.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:34.459
So over time, people work from home masks
becoming a requirement.

00:03:34.459 --> 00:03:35.470
Businesses have to close.

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:38.409
Supermarkets have to put in place more and
more guidelines.

00:03:38.409 --> 00:03:39.940
Parks have to close.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:47.390
They only insist on their rights in a total
vacuum where their responsibilities are not

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:49.930
being met and aren't even being discussed.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:55.550
It is petulant, childish nonsense to simply
say my rights, my rights, my rights and pretend

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.840
that you have no responsibility to society.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:00.280
And in fact, it's what Donald Trump does.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:01.519
It's mimicking Trump.

00:04:01.519 --> 00:04:02.569
It's basically this.

00:04:02.569 --> 00:04:03.569
I want to.

00:04:03.569 --> 00:04:04.569
I want to.

00:04:04.569 --> 00:04:07.640
I want to stuff and nothing else matters.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:13.769
Your right to get your hair dyed so that your
roots don't show must happen in the context

00:04:13.769 --> 00:04:18.029
of ensuring that you're not getting people
sick where there's a when and where there

00:04:18.029 --> 00:04:19.689
is a deadly virus spreading.

00:04:19.689 --> 00:04:23.139
And so then they will shift their bogus bad
faith arguments.

00:04:23.139 --> 00:04:25.819
Liberals want the economy closed.

00:04:25.819 --> 00:04:30.800
They want to hurt businesses, maybe to hurt
Donald Trump in November.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:36.999
Find me an actual example with evidence of
someone who makes it clear they want the economy

00:04:36.999 --> 00:04:42.080
hurt either for the sake of hurting the economy
or to hurt Donald Trump or whatever.

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.999
I will be right there with you in slamming
them.

00:04:43.999 --> 00:04:45.939
I've been clear from day one.

00:04:45.939 --> 00:04:49.599
Trump has long outstate, is welcome, overstayed
as welcome in the White House.

00:04:49.599 --> 00:04:51.410
We didn't need his coronavirus failings.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:54.939
We don't need a higher death toll to justify
removing Donald Trump in November.

00:04:54.939 --> 00:04:59.919
I don't want anybody to lose their business
or their job or their life because of Corona

00:04:59.919 --> 00:05:01.889
virus for a political statement.

00:05:01.889 --> 00:05:07.569
But the irresponsible people who talk only
about their rights as the reason why we are

00:05:07.569 --> 00:05:09.300
here today.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.860
Every right comes with another side of the
coin.

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:15.020
The First Amendment, the right to free speech
and freedom of religion and right to assemble

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:16.690
until.

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:21.889
You're assembling in a way that infringes
on others or using the speech to incite violence.

00:05:21.889 --> 00:05:23.659
Use the right responsibly.

00:05:23.659 --> 00:05:27.860
The Second Amendment, you have the right to
keep and bear arms, of course.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:32.199
As long as you behave responsibly in your
life, as long as you don't commit certain

00:05:32.199 --> 00:05:38.780
crimes where you have to forfeit your right
to bear those arms, the right comes with responsibility.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:44.220
The freedom of my fist, as the example goes
to fly around, stops at your nose.

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:47.729
And if I don't use that freedom responsibly,
I will be in trouble.

00:05:47.729 --> 00:05:53.080
So every time one of these protesters is demanding
their rights in a vacuum with no discussion

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.879
of the responsibility that they will bring.

00:05:55.879 --> 00:05:57.349
Let's hear from them.

00:05:57.349 --> 00:05:59.419
What responsible behavior?

00:05:59.419 --> 00:06:01.199
They are bringing to the table.

00:06:01.199 --> 00:06:05.319
Otherwise, it's just B.S. and that's what
we're increasingly seeing.

